        "comments": "The assembly bAnsAlb1.hap2.1 is based on 54x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial genome was assembled using MitoHiFi. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome Z was identified by alignment to Anser Fabalis GCA_965250395.1",
